  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"由 Serilum 開發的模組。充滿愛心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「儲存與載入背包」模組新增了指令，讓使用者能夠輕鬆將目前的背包內容儲存至檔案、從檔案載入背包，以及列出目前儲存的背包清單。對於伺服器管理員或活動伺服器非常實用。支援 NBT 標籤，因此像是已書寫的書籍或附魔等物品都不會成為問題。玩家需要使用作弊權限才能使用這些指令。<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Th</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">e 背包資料會儲存於 ./config/saveandloadinventories/*.txt。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/customization-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum 的客製化套件中\" width=\"416\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"運行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/commands.svg\" alt=\"指令\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/saveinventory &lt;背包名稱&gt;</em> - 將使用者的目前背包儲存為 &lt;背包名稱&gt;。</span><br>&nbsp; 別名： <em>/si &lt;背包名稱&gt;</em><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/loadinventory &lt;背包名稱&gt;</em> - 載入先前儲存的 &lt;背包名稱&gt; 背包。</span><br>&nbsp; 別名： <em>/li &lt;背包名稱&gt;</em><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>/loadinventory &lt;背包名稱&gt; &lt;玩家名稱&gt;&nbsp;</em>- 將背包載入至指定玩家 &lt;玩家名稱&gt;<br><em><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&nbsp; 別名： /li &lt;背包名稱&gt; &lt;玩家名稱&gt;</span><br>/listinventories</em> - 列出所有已儲存的背包。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">將目前背包以「diamond」為名稱儲存（<em>/saveinventory diamond</em>）：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/save-and-load-inventories/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"591\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">接著載入它時（<em>/loadinventory diamond</em>）：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/save-and-load-inventories/b.webp\" width=\"1000\" height=\"514\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">使用縮寫指令以「food」為名稱儲存目前背包（<em>/si food</em>）：</span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/save-and-load-inventories/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"591\"><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">接著使用縮寫指令載入它（<em>/li food</em>）：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/save-and-load-inventories/d.webp\" width=\"1000\" height=\"514\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以下是設定其他玩家背包的範例：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/save-and-load-inventories/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"1093\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您就可以在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面中追蹤留言，評論功能已關閉。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 存放庫</a> 提出。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
